-466b-b3dc-5b7b1e876a54" ulx="41" uly="1327" lrx="469" lry="1364" /><zone xml:id="m-040251fa-1444-444e-99bf-2cd70aec3b4c" ulx="64" uly="1356" lrx="619" lry="1396" /><zone xml:id="m-1cdb1945-f1e1-41ea-a972-1b1bd55f14ca" ulx="356" uly="1391" lrx="589" lry="1421" /><zone xml:id="m-d9868e78-6a36-4d12-82ea-fb645c80e2b7" ulx="49" uly="1418" lrx="904" lry="1454" /><zone xml:id="m-788cf1f0-3f50-487e-8741-445bd717600a" ulx="47" uly="1445" lrx="903" lry="1486" /><zone xml:id="m-d0b6146c-fd6a-4791-b072-a2ed0155b0cd" ulx="43" uly="1472" lrx="681" lry="1510" /><zone xml:id="m-a7fc06ea-a9ef-4168-8ac0-5d5f007fd9aa" ulx="64" uly="1502" lrx="685" lry="1540" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-9ae5a2f8-46dc-4fa7-9a7b-258bd74cd4ff" n="1269" facs="#m-83da08d5-5aa7-4902-8976-b5674479f9df" /><div xml:id="m-d6f38919-adf4-46de-9ba4-9a083ef7a072">
            <lg xml:id="m-2727ad5e-ac47-4a78-8c8e-b73a0a50beaf">
              <l xml:id="m-f1c07d84-2769-4cdd-8c6c-f8b63a503c79" facs="#m-da7fb3f6-37d0-40b8-9ea9-9124ad4e028b" label="text-like">24th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-5a3baf5b-a409-4b3f-9383-64ac58a432ec" facs="#m-581c1576-c622-4dee-8244-bd2d3cff49d3" label="ambiguous">1079</l><l xml:id="m-7341d4bd-c9d0-49fe-a1d9-c84dc0a1f81d" facs="#m-1236e467-e1d5-4401-aec1-df77e83ab1c8" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Colossenses. Col. T. b.</l><l xml:id="m-d18b85d3-a73f-4cc1-addb-eb006cb9b9a5" facs="#m-5f57a439-159f-4c3f-9b7b-a6c8884df9dc" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Non cessámus pro vo- tátis ejus, in omni patiéntia, et</l><l xml:id="m-ee7cf731-ec16-4b93-9ece-4d276960f2c1" facs="#m-a2277dd9-b3ef-4bfd-9181-2562022112a8" label="lyrics-like">bis orántes et postulántes, ut im-llonganimitáte cum gáudio, grátias</l><l xml:id="m-e95adc98-a618-4889-86be-a07226ed9da0" facs="#m-74aa7b55-3d1f-4a67-a87a-df936b9faf7d" label="lyrics-like">pleámini agnitióne voluntátis Dei</l><l xml:id="m-180c63d6-204f-49d7-8ecf-bc648d5acedc" facs="#m-2e04e9c2-675e-4190-841a-c508b0f6cc7a" label="lyrics-like">agéntes Deo Patri, qui dignos nos</l><l xml:id="m-2cecf328-0101-48e1-8420-d9924dae66d3" facs="#m-42700e5f-3905-434c-b2bd-b2ffb55fbf6d" label="lyrics-like">in omni sapiéntia et intelléctu spi¬</l><l xml:id="m-7781cec7-ab2e-49ec-af09-574ff080596e" facs="#m-2d00fa80-6550-415d-b99e-a5368005560c" label="lyrics-like">fecit in partem sortis sanctórum in</l><l xml:id="m-0a5995f3-d6ad-4f34-8374-4fa8cfabf682" facs="#m-fa9508f5-30a0-4087-970d-de823b2993fe" label="lyrics-like">ritáli : ut ambulétis digne Deo per</l><l xml:id="m-8350bd50-87ca-4307-8e25-a9fa5a0349df" facs="#m-2f56a014-dc3b-4ae3-84a9-47890ae3a6e2" label="lyrics-like">lúmine : qui eripuit nos de potestáte</l><l xml:id="m-47bea21a-684c-4375-afe7-7a5e5f8f0b13" facs="#m-6cdbd1ad-e049-4233-977f-496ffd0f2bcb" label="lyrics-like">omnia placéntes: in omni ópere</l><l xml:id="m-16131f36-f4f0-4e4b-a5a0-d6ff4232440b" facs="#m-8b6123b4-5c47-4739-b5a8-1c9e8ae769cc" label="lyrics-like">tenebrárum, et tránstulit in regnum</l><l xml:id="m-0c93db1d-f204-4759-809b-5f89de60297b" facs="#m-2fd19bf5-6a53-4ff7-a089-79a40b078bd2" label="lyrics-like">bono fructificántes, et crescéntes in</l><l xml:id="m-113d44c9-c0f6-4200-8958-e6da681c39d5" facs="#m-ce86a838-95e2-4470-83bb-82103244d94c" label="lyrics-like">Filii dilectiónis suae; in quo habé¬</l><l xml:id="m-a9e19856-a88b-4598-b055-d6870e21e391" facs="#m-8cb3bd7a-e776-4681-a99c-bec7ebbcbeb7" label="lyrics-like">sciéntia Dei: in omni virtúte con¬</l><l xml:id="m-5e568948-d171-43c8-bf09-e2f9e3d0cf1b" facs="#m-76e94ed3-3ed8-4055-8bb2-7d5be69cd364" label="lyrics-like">mus redemptiónem per sánguinem</l><l xml:id="m-d96a4f02-95b2-4823-bf0b-66367620cb66" facs="#m-067d21aa-4d21-43ab-9b56-6f160b11fc2f" label="lyrics-like">fortáti secúndum poténtiam clari-l ejus, remissiónem peccatórum.</l><l xml:id="m-aabfb920-40e1-441c-b867-c701bf8ace6c" facs="#m-014e0443-268c-47c5-8b3d-c6e78a42bb89" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 24. b.</l><l xml:id="m-cba85eaa-58f5-4fa6-89e0-b96bc5e65154" facs="#m-3ab825b3-a8d1-4496-be41-20a4807585b6" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus di- ab Oriénte, et paret usque in Occi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b8db89e9-4166-4f89-9bdb-8351323ad9d2" facs="#m-c184e429-5a9c-41e8-869f-d6123a155466" label="lyrics-like">L scipulis suis : Cum vidéritis abo¬</l><l xml:id="m-cbb6bb22-3871-4f49-b3bd-f61163761fe2" facs="#m-321a765f-9a21-4f84-8127-c2e328282b4e" label="lyrics-like">déntem:ita erit et advéntus Filii hó¬</l><l xml:id="m-fa6c6c0d-86b7-42ee-8d6a-a5fe01c67028" facs="#m-2830b437-ed6d-4679-a8a8-6c6643d6aac4" label="lyrics-like">minatiónem desolatiónis, quae dicta</l><l xml:id="m-94704015-848f-4384-8c0a-a5f4a602f732" facs="#m-9ec80459-dcae-499d-8346-03a8359d07a1" label="lyrics-like">minis. Ubicúmque fúerit corpus, illic</l><l xml:id="m-3b006fb8-4822-4e4c-8947-32b76518fc3d" facs="#m-60765952-d9c3-4dd8-8bc1-ac37e341b4c2" label="lyrics-like">est a Daniéle prophéta, stantem in</l><l xml:id="m-9353fa2a-124c-4e70-bf92-9c6947039df9" facs="#m-83c4fed7-0e7d-458b-832d-32d945ab6641" label="lyrics-like">congregabúntur et áquilae. Statim</l><l xml:id="m-80aa8e23-b543-432c-aea0-ad964e907163" facs="#m-06dbd77f-6882-44ab-9a68-b444b2663e5b" label="lyrics-like">loco sancto : qui legit, intélligat:</l><l xml:id="m-dc8abd58-db39-4702-8291-2472cdab7778" facs="#m-bec13182-b774-44ec-8fde-c1977d6e6fed" label="lyrics-like">autem post tribulatiónemdiérum illó¬</l><l xml:id="m-5dfa0980-13c9-4be4-a76b-76c8245a7063" facs="#m-85154e0b-082e-4167-b728-bbffa122c4c4" label="lyrics-like">tunc qui in Judaéa sunt, fúgiant ad</l><l xml:id="m-7dc3886c-5284-41f6-8f50-16e7a6d2a217" facs="#m-1e41591c-703b-44ca-900d-0962eb51713b" label="lyrics-like">rum sol obscurábitur, et luna non da¬</l><l xml:id="m-7a37b1fd-8fbb-4f1f-94f8-859754a59bc1" facs="#m-35b261ab-92b6-44e9-a39d-96978eba4f3f" label="lyrics-like">montes : et qui in tecto, non descén¬</l><l xml:id="m-680fb226-4eee-4e68-9b86-b91c3232c167" facs="#m-c67a6458-cce0-40c1-b837-e90f829beb15" label="ambiguous">bit lumen suum, et stellae cadent de</l><l xml:id="m-502800eb-04cb-4905-93d2-3ec4f435265f" facs="#m-d999d5e3-6d90-4ec8-bb03-f2c710f1533f" label="lyrics-like">dat tóllere áliquid de domo sua: et</l><l xml:id="m-e107983e-72fb-4ca6-bc58-92267403f991" facs="#m-143611ac-bd6f-457d-8c28-1d192826dbb8" label="lyrics-like">caelo, et virtútes caelórum commo¬</l><l xml:id="m-128ea9b3-1c45-4d5d-aef1-a5ef6b47b735" facs="#m-276c5601-404c-4b84-ac33-e9628084ac6d" label="lyrics-like">vebúntur : et tunc parébit signum</l><l xml:id="m-0b4c4790-447b-4014-8efd-c247f0c88eb5" facs="#m-aa49a592-36c3-4e62-81cf-f5efc4c20301" label="lyrics-like">qui in agro, non revertátur tóllere</l><l xml:id="m-ee06821b-0f73-4fc3-9d26-51cd00139786" facs="#m-81b78943-4637-494e-91cb-b6e542831132" label="lyrics-like">Filii hóminis in caelo : et tunc plan¬</l><l xml:id="m-077d7acd-cbd6-4649-9f4e-b88a86f4bbff" facs="#m-57c3c3b5-4bc3-4d00-87e4-846b657962c3" label="lyrics-like">túnicam suam. Vae autem prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8063595-cecd-410e-8468-b820a44a3aee" facs="#m-0e73a9ca-15f3-4a0f-b957-30761456f1a3" label="lyrics-like">gnántibus, et nutriéntibus in illis</l><l xml:id="m-fe68f0c5-010f-4d8a-a594-48f28bebbb5e" facs="#m-06fcc790-e9af-4f60-a134-a1287c1175ec" label="lyrics-like">gent omnes tribus terrae: et vidé¬</l><l xml:id="m-758d68bc-ff8e-4dce-94aa-634359fca259" facs="#m-931e3ca2-6b52-483d-98b3-2a8b72129680" label="lyrics-like">bunt Filium hóminis veniéntem in</l><l xml:id="m-7e2c60bf-24ee-41c6-be42-37d2fbb82c12" facs="#m-5f545980-e512-4f19-8e95-dc8fa636edad" label="lyrics-like">diébus. Oráte autem, ut non fiat</l><l xml:id="m-ffb1dedd-2623-473e-978f-164248a06f1b" facs="#m-18b84a4d-a1b9-4d86-a4ab-3225afe0293f" label="lyrics-like">fuga vestra in hieme, vel sábbato.</l><l xml:id="m-577c7fb6-137c-46dd-8dc4-ee6fb2130a5a" facs="#m-d5a05a76-edaa-4b3b-a5f3-07af66ff89dc" label="lyrics-like">núbibus caeli cum virtúte multa, et</l><l xml:id="m-f51e28ff-3e77-4dea-a918-0b9805f6a6db" facs="#m-0bc87880-9e62-4edb-859f-0dde47885701" label="lyrics-like">Erit enim tunc tribulátio magna.</l><l xml:id="m-8022c7ae-8688-4132-a9d4-af99b4566437" facs="#m-8d34e931-2a5d-40c4-bdab-faada8a195cd" label="lyrics-like">majestáte. Et mittet Angelos suos</l><l xml:id="m-38d66976-02ce-4b58-85b6-1c237435e03b" facs="#m-23bf71f1-687d-43d9-b8b1-5dfd63a7de8a" label="ambiguous">qualis non fuit ab initio mundi</l><l xml:id="m-b729fe1c-a243-4f54-a91e-12e3406073ed" facs="#m-db4cc7cc-bb53-48d6-baf4-184203384f9e" label="ambiguous">cum tuba, et voce magna : et con¬</l><l xml:id="m-ec06b1a5-8501-4bb5-a3be-2931ce665802" facs="#m-74483c35-849e-42de-9e56-509dc19df97b" label="lyrics-like">gregábunt eléctos ejus a quátuor</l><l xml:id="m-dc8019f2-8078-4d13-97e4-6d66e60679ae" facs="#m-85c15563-8fce-4f67-860b-a6a787997498" label="ambiguous">usque modo, neque fiet. Et nisi bre¬</l><l xml:id="m-2542f5a6-a49b-458e-a8ca-ee2d881f23b9" facs="#m-a1ddf11d-4cd3-4425-aabb-1fd741a49989" label="lyrics-like">viáti fuissent dies illi, non fieret</l><l xml:id="m-c318883c-f6d9-4dad-8ae4-f91df462be5d" facs="#m-5ce41238-4a75-4d7c-a3b2-b734a2e4ea18" label="lyrics-like">ventis, a summis caelórum usque</l><l xml:id="m-e713e55c-a585-4f6d-9585-4cedd34e2c8f" facs="#m-36fbff59-2324-4b1d-9b50-cac071630644" label="lyrics-like">ad términos eórum. Ab árbore au¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f337c7b-ee57-4a8d-9b04-2d8daf92ef07" facs="#m-a540d25b-4da7-4223-ac08-ad17d099d328" label="lyrics-like">salva omnis caro: sed propter elé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d87c31aa-9cfe-4aa6-8df9-97e9c8c2806c" facs="#m-4c9df19d-929d-4964-9e6d-11a3e11bb4f5" label="lyrics-like">ctos breviabúntur dies îlli. Tunc si</l><l xml:id="m-cdc6f159-8c5a-4d64-adb0-8fb651bdc8e6" facs="#m-f9443f8d-af91-4a2f-8d10-3595ea83064e" label="lyrics-like">tem fici discite parábolam: cum</l><l xml:id="m-21e4a4b0-927c-4179-8834-fe407837e602" facs="#m-10742d5e-72f8-4568-9ecb-d4f6c95b841a" label="ambiguous">quis vobis dixerit: Ecce hic est</l><l xml:id="m-956679fc-dd4e-4312-8ee5-dcebef71f58c" facs="#m-ad354ace-8c6d-46e8-a76c-7483a55b7f73" label="lyrics-like">jam ramus ejus tener fúerit, et fólia</l><l xml:id="m-17ff1c92-fb03-4d15-b0c3-6b1da96d1c47" facs="#m-179d4feb-2a16-4107-bf2b-9226eee90ca3" label="lyrics-like">Christus, aut illic: nolîte crédere.</l><l xml:id="m-44af0928-ce21-4e5a-b03f-3c833d4b058b" facs="#m-896b2870-0b27-4969-8486-dfc75ea49297" label="ambiguous">nata, scitis quia prope est aestas:</l><l xml:id="m-3d5406f4-2a93-4bc2-98f4-4f3ade9f08e9" facs="#m-9d1d4c54-64d5-4545-9056-a23c8885b055" label="ambiguous">Surgent enim pseudochristi et pseu¬</l><l xml:id="m-e2320ec4-26c4-4f36-9eb5-041a919bb47a" facs="#m-8818ebd1-f3ef-4db9-88ba-60c11758f95e" label="lyrics-like">ita et vos, cum vidéritis haec ómnia,</l><l xml:id="m-34fcfab7-f8d5-4756-abf3-2fcb2c189efc" facs="#m-0d11d35e-16d5-477d-aa39-0d1e1424f3cb" label="lyrics-like">scitóte quia prope est in januis.</l><l xml:id="m-5764c913-6aa1-4b54-8cec-9184465b3ce4" facs="#m-2f522f31-929d-4623-9dff-0e023c6eb064" label="lyrics-like">doprophétae, et dabunt signa ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-fd2deb37-b666-4e9b-b92b-f9ffdf91997b" facs="#m-3982b733-280a-4afa-80af-7e7b3918b0f7" label="lyrics-like">gna, et prodígia, ita ut in errórem</l><l xml:id="m-6e033e63-39e4-4caf-9c81-21a910da9b8d" facs="#m-6deca1cf-8daf-415b-8840-934991d27d7b" label="ambiguous">Amen dico vobis, quia non praeter¬</l><l xml:id="m-f72c4003-4b31-4943-afc7-1a2f066292f5" facs="#m-e74cbc8f-fa70-4c4b-8c12-57a25a041144" label="lyrics-like">ibit generátio haec, donec ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-487508ed-c29e-430b-b580-a4cc28cbbacb" facs="#m-bbb47f29-3021-4d02-9ce7-57bb39cb3b8c" label="lyrics-like">inducántur (si fieri potest) étiam elé¬</l><l xml:id="m-667d75b4-c3c6-47fc-a29c-9880608605d6" facs="#m-98523dc1-ed6d-48f9-ad9e-5139641ef181" label="lyrics-like">cti. Ecce praedíxi vobis. Si ergo di¬</l><l xml:id="m-2d07c5e7-135c-4c2d-9953-1025e092060a" facs="#m-ef6cbaff-eb67-41ce-81ba-f96a6d74f7a8" label="ambiguous">haec fiant. Caelum et terra trans¬</l><l xml:id="m-1ef94984-05e4-4413-b889-d91f1f054059" facs="#m-f10cab9d-8b8b-481f-8d91-1d50b3a0761e" label="lyrics-like">xerint vobis: Ecce in desérto est,</l><l xml:id="m-8ef5fde9-ea3f-4be4-8243-f04a871462ef" facs="#m-3f5882e3-37e6-46fd-94e1-39ade87e440a" label="ambiguous">ibunt, verba autem mea non prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-0cf477a2-4dd3-4d54-b6d7-d004fdcebdeb" facs="#m-b72768b4-1a45-4d7f-9786-79717cdffe18" label="ambiguous">teribunt.</l><l xml:id="m-eeaacf2c-4018-41d1-8faf-eafaaab7157c" facs="#m-b405a91a-f687-4f0d-bafe-56e9e9b3ac36" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-97ea67b0-3564-403d-85fd-66d06de9eb85" facs="#m-5ae149bc-64e2-42a4-aaaa-7061856272f8" label="lyrics-like">nolite exire; eccein penetrálibus, no¬</l><l xml:id="m-e597e465-7b95-4faf-a430-040c41e05d20" facs="#m-04171453-2b23-409a-a12e-695c30e607d4" label="lyrics-like">lite crédere. Sicut enim fulgur exit</l><l xml:id="m-19de84f3-26a8-45f2-8f4b-006137f1affc" facs="#m-785cbc70-9e9d-447b-973d-c288eb6bb4bc" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-be600c89-faff-48a7-bf07-60f1d2e01634" facs="#m-01286842-a849-40cd-bc92-421c29289724" label="lyrics-like">ORopítius esto, Dómine, suppli-[convérte; ut a terrénis cupiditáti¬</l><l xml:id="m-b9a4fd2e-33bc-4056-8ce6-00a1e9feda91" facs="#m-9e15b3c4-7dda-4790-bb0c-22c5216f6b3b" label="lyrics-like">bus liberáti, ad caeléstia desidéria</l><l xml:id="m-f19ff769-99df-48bf-aa0d-7d0c259beef3" facs="#m-df4c515b-a5fa-4a5f-83dd-4ede1e090ae4" label="lyrics-like">Lcatiónibus nostris: et pópuli</l><l xml:id="m-1d34cc1f-4446-4cdd-a27b-438468e2fd3a" facs="#m-24aebab3-9961-4a54-b214-85ccdb4eace4" label="lyrics-like">tui oblatiónibus, precibúsque suscé¬</l><l xml:id="m-680a409a-10de-42c4-8ac6-3b2a7945263d" facs="#m-21564044-5be6-4af9-b92c-0ae092fd6c68" label="lyrics-like">transeámus. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-0d73513d-f7b4-49c6-8651-9e967bc95ff6" facs="#m-2e69fec3-8170-466b-b3dc-5b7b1e876a54" label="lyrics-like">ptis, ómnium nostrum ad te corda</l><l xml:id="m-d7cbd7fb-3d11-41bf-b4fa-0a8103a1fcdb" facs="#m-040251fa-1444-444e-99bf-2cd70aec3b4c" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-55823c84-95dc-450b-949e-21000dcbab30" facs="#m-1cdb1945-f1e1-41ea-a972-1b1bd55f14ca" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-9a35aa93-03f3-4ebe-923e-fc2feedf9a35" facs="#m-d9868e78-6a36-4d12-82ea-fb645c80e2b7" label="lyrics-like">(Voncéde nobis, quaésumus Dó-[ stra mente vitiósum est, ipsórum</l><l xml:id="m-a689a27a-acf2-40da-9fd4-0014b1b3bad2" facs="#m-788cf1f0-3f50-487e-8741-445bd717600a" label="lyrics-like">L mine : ut per haec sacraménta medicatiónis dono curétur. Per Do¬</l><l xml:id="m-03be9112-4608-4fdb-a74a-1079402cb489" facs="#m-d0b6146c-fd6a-4791-b072-a2ed0155b0cd" label="lyrics-like">quae súmpsimus, quidquid in no-l minum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-30bdc622-1291-4319-81e7-5a1cc053769d" facs="#m-a7fc06ea-a9ef-4168-8ac0-5d5f007fd9aa" label="lyrics-like">2. Mundet et múniat. p. 502. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>